<title>FINLAND: LAHDESMAKI LEAVES HUHTAMAKI BOARD.</title>
<headline>LAHDESMAKI LEAVES HUHTAMAKI BOARD.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish confectionery and packaging group Huhtamaki Oy said in a statement that Leiras' managing director Tuomo Lahdesmaki had left Huhtamki's board on September 2 due to the sale of Leiras to Schering .</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
